{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13611","headline":"襄阳乐 · 郑锡","name":"襄阳乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春生岘首东，先煖习池风。\n拂水初含绿，惊林未吐红。\n渚边游汉女，桑下问庞公。\n磨灭怀中刺，曾将示孔融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}